; pnpm-only. Prisma's @prisma/client re-exports its generated client via a
; relative import (`.prisma/client/default`). Under pnpm's isolated install,
; that lookup resolves inside .pnpm/<hash>/node_modules/ and never finds the
; generated client at the project root. Hoisting all Prisma packages to the
; root node_modules tree fixes the resolution without changing the schema.
public-hoist-pattern[]=*prisma*
